  planner_response {
    response: "I have added a sophisticated, floral-themed preloader to ensure a graceful entry into the caf\303\251 experience. \n\nHere is an overview of the design additions:\n\n*   **Custom Floral Vector Animation**: At the center of the preloader, a minimalist SVG floral emblem elegantly draws itself onto the screen using Framer Motion\'s `pathLength` animation. \n*   **Layered Cinematic Entrance**:\n    *   The preloader uses the same rich, textured cream paper background from our page transitions.\n    *   The Blueberrys Caf\303\251 wordmark fades in softly below the floral crest.\n    *   An elegant, ultra-thin progress line scales across the screen to communicate loading state.\n*   **Seamless Hand-off**: The component automatically locks scrolling via Lenis while active. Once the window is fully loaded (and our cinematic minimum display time of 2.5 seconds is met), the preloader gracefully slides up and out of the viewport, seamlessly revealing the main hero section underneath."
    modified_response: "I have added a sophisticated, floral-themed preloader to ensure a graceful entry into the caf\303\251 experience. \n\nHere is an overview of the design additions:\n\n*   **Custom Floral Vector Animation**: At the center of the preloader, a minimalist SVG floral emblem elegantly draws itself onto the screen using Framer Motion\'s `pathLength` animation. \n*   **Layered Cinematic Entrance**:\n    *   The preloader uses the same rich, textured cream paper background from our page transitions.\n    *   The Blueberrys Caf\303\251 wordmark fades in softly below the floral crest.\n    *   An elegant, ultra-thin progress line scales across the screen to communicate loading state.\n*   **Seamless Hand-off**: The component automatically locks scrolling via Lenis while active. Once the window is fully loaded (and our cinematic minimum display time of 2.5 seconds is met), the preloader gracefully slides up and out of the viewport, seamlessly revealing the main hero section underneath."
